d_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"DkVFvHGyNBGuPMzI9Zdt1A","review_id":"5Zc-41gwFJ1MWBvJS7B3qw","date":"2012-01-09T18:13:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.947001576423645,"text_excerpt":"Great hot dogs. Hip atmosphere. Service is worth the wait. I was eying the Crawfish dog on the menu but it sounded like a possible gimmick so I asked the cashier what she would recommend and that was at the top of the list so I figured it must be legit. The hot dogs are sausage sized and come with your choice of any number of complimentary topping. I went with onions, cheese, chili, and ketchup. All the standards were available along with some crazy options like Sour Cream and Guacamole that I appreciate them offering but I was not brave enough to try on a hot dog. My hot dog was great. I finished it really fast because it was so delicious, but it was a full meal. The cheese fries were a ..."},{"business_id":"DkVFvHGyNBGuPMzI9Zdt1A","review_id":"Q_FsRyjIuF09aTNoifibdA","date":"2015-09-09T23:43:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9469553232192993,"text_excerpt":"The hot dogs are pretty great. I like the traditional dog topped with chili of course, but on another visit, I really also enjoyed the traditional topped with siraccha sauce and diced tomatoes. That's been my favorite thus far. I also tried a smoked sausage with pico de gallo, but that combo was ok, but not as good as I had hoped. The white trash fries are excellent. They're basically fully loaded cheese fries and the toppings are what you'd tend to find on a order of loaded nachos. I could just get an order of the fries and be full. The only cocktail I've ever had here is the Pink Panther which is vodka based and I thoroughly enjoyed that as well. Of all the locations for Dat Dog, I thin..."},{"business_id":"DkVFvHGyNBGuPMzI9Zdt1A","review_id":"jRnK6rf3oKZrsMDhOW77rw","date":"2013-03-16T06:17:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9455674886703491,"text_excerpt":"A couple things up front to ensure you have a great Dat Dog experience: First of all, they are CASH ONLY. It can get pretty crowded and you don't want to wait in line for a long time only to find you need cash. Second, there is something about his place where as soon as you get to the front of the line you forget what you want. Dat Dog always makes me panic like a grandma in Subway for the first time. Probably because there's so many choices to be made. Lastly, it can get pretty crowded on weekends, if you hate crowds (like me), try checking it out during the week. I have loved this place since they were in the shack across the street. I usually get a classic but simple dog: classic beef ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"DkVFvHGyNBGuPMzI9Zdt1A","photo_id":"YF-LPF0pPKh_o2KYqEQISw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/YF-LPF0pPKh_o2KYqEQISw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.873207688331604},{"business_id":"DkVFvHGyNBGuPMzI9Zdt1A","photo_id":"BzzNbU82O5r_M3